. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.         * Please add a verbal description of your model here
. 
.         * As an example, and for illustrative purposes we consider a: linear 
> OLS regression
. 
.         * For illustrative purposes, let's further assume that having a job t
> hat requires hard manual labor (plb0085) is a good measure of political attit
> udes (hypothesis 2),
.         * if having a job with less manual labor, the respondent is more like
> ly to have left-leaning political attitudes.
.         * Accordingly, we run a linear OLS regression analysis with plb0085 a
> s dependent variable and the dummy variable d_daughter as independent variabl
> e
. 
.         
.         
. qui g politicalview=plh0004     

. qui replace politicalview=. if plh0004<0

